# Input

```scss
$gap:16px;
@media(min-width:/*before*/-/*operand*/$gap /*binary*/+ 800px){.block{display:block}}
@media (min-width: // before
-// operand
$gap+800px){.line{display:block}}
@media/*outer*/(min-width:-$gap+800px/*close*/)/*conjunction*/and/*next*/(max-width:+$gap+800px)/*block*/{.boundaries{display:block}}
@media(min-width:-$gap+800px // close
){.line-boundary{display:block}}
@media(min-width:-$gap+800px)/*comma*/,// next
(max-width:+$gap+800px){.comma{display:block}}
/* biome-ignore format: preserve authored query spacing */
@media (min-width: - $gap + 800px) { .suppressed {display:block} }

```


# Formatted

```scss
$gap: 16px;
@media (/*before*/ min-width: -/*operand*/ $gap /*binary*/ + 800px) {
	.block {
		display: block;
	}
}
@media (
		// before
		min-width: -// operand
		$gap +
			800px
	) {
	.line {
		display: block;
	}
}
@media /*outer*/ (
		min-width: -$gap + 800px /*close*/
	) /*conjunction*/ and /*next*/ (max-width: +$gap + 800px) /*block*/ {
	.boundaries {
		display: block;
	}
}
@media (
		min-width: -$gap + 800px // close
	) {
	.line-boundary {
		display: block;
	}
}
@media (min-width: -$gap + 800px) /*comma*/, // next
	(max-width: +$gap + 800px) {
	.comma {
		display: block;
	}
}
/* biome-ignore format: preserve authored query spacing */
@media (min-width: - $gap + 800px) { .suppressed {display:block} }

```
